OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer acquitted of sex assault
OL,4,Ato face police misconduct hearing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who was acquitted of
OL,7,Ftwo counts of sexual assault will now
OL,8,Fface misconduct proceedings.
OL,10,FFiona Anderson, 33, was found not
OL,11,Fguilty by a jury of sexually assaulting
OL,12,Fa woman following a night out in
OL,13,FCardiff in 2018.
OL,15,FThe officer, who serves with Devon and
OL,16,FCornwall Police, has been suspended
OL,17,Fsince her arrest in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
