OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer acquitted of sex assault
OL,4,Ato face police misconduct hearing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the officer remained
OL,7,F"subject to an ongoing misconduct
OL,8,Fprocess under police conduct
OL,9,Fregulations" following the conclusion
OL,10,Fof the criminal case at Bristol Crown
OL,11,FCourt.
